<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Mixture of Many Zero-Compute Experts:A High-Rate Quantization Theory Perspective" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>MoE for Multidimensional Inputs: The Expert Segment Density that Minimizes the Test-Error Upper Bound</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Mixture of Many Zero-Compute Experts:A High-Rate Quantization Theory Perspective" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Proofs for Section <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a>
